  "name": "Beef Estofado",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered beef with potatoes, beans, herbs, and chile",
  "description": "Beef chuck is simmered with beer or stock, chile pastes, aromatics, potatoes, beans, tomatoes, and herbs until tender.",
